---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Eat & Shop
seoTitle: Niwot Restaurants, Shops & Local Services | TownofNiwot.com
description: Niwot, Colorado restaurants, coffee, shops, wellness and local services in Old Town and Cottonwood Square, each listing checked against its own source.
navKey: eat-shop
permalink: /eat-shop/
ogImage: niwot-tavern-patios.jpg
ogImageAlt: Patios outside the Niwot Tavern and Raza Fresa at Cottonwood Square
footMetaRight: Hours and contact details via each business
scripts:
  - /assets/js/directory.js
pageStyles: |
  .n-dir-open{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.86fr) minmax(0,1.14fr);gap:clamp(28px,4vw,68px);align-items:center}
  .n-quickcats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1px;margin-top:clamp(24px,3vw,38px);background:var(--n-rule);border:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-quickcats a{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;padding:13px 15px;background:var(--n-white);color:var(--n-evergreen);font-size:.875rem;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none}
  .n-quickcats a:hover{background:var(--n-paper);color:var(--n-red-ink)}
  .n-dir{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,.3fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:clamp(24px,3vw,60px);align-items:start}
  .n-filters{position:sticky;top:88px}
  .n-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(150px,.34fr);gap:16px 28px;align-items:start;padding:22px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-cats{margin:26px 0 0;padding:0;border:0;min-width:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--n-rule)}
  .n-cats legend{padding:0;margin:0 0 8px}
  .n-chip{position:relative;display:block}
  .n-chip input{position:absolute;top:50%;left:14px;width:1px;height:1px;margin:0;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}
  .n-chip-l{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:12px;width:100%;padding:13px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--n-rule);color:var(--n-ink);font-size:1rem;line-height:1.35;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s ease,color .18s ease}
  .n-chip:hover .n-chip-l{background:var(--n-paper)}
  .n-chip input:checked + .n-chip-l{background:var(--n-evergreen);color:var(--n-white)}
  .n-chip-n{color:var(--n-muted)}
  .n-chip input:checked + .n-chip-l .n-chip-n{color:var(--n-gold-lt)}
  .n-chip input:focus-visible + .n-chip-l{outline:2px solid var(--n-red);outline-offset:-4px}
  /* The ring sits inside the chip, so on the checked chip's evergreen ground
     it has to be the light gold, as on the site's other dark grounds. */
  .n-chip input:checked:focus-visible + .n-chip-l{outline-color:var(--n-gold-lt)}
  /* The category selector for a phone: one control instead of ten tiles. It
     is script-driven and sits outside the form, so a submit without a
     script never sends a second category value. */
  .n-dir-select{display:none;margin-top:22px}
  .n-dir-select select{display:block;width:100%;min-height:50px;margin-top:8px;padding:12px 14px;background:var(--n-white);border:2px solid var(--n-evergreen);font:inherit;font-size:1rem;color:var(--n-ink)}
  /* The strip that names the filter in force, with its reset. */
  .n-active{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 18px;align-items:center;margin-top:14px;padding:10px 14px;background:var(--n-paper);border-left:3px solid var(--n-red)}
  .n-dir-clear{padding:0;background:none;border:0;border-bottom:1px solid currentColor;color:var(--n-sky-ink);font:inherit;font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500;cursor:pointer}
  .n-dir-clear:hover{color:var(--n-red-ink)}
  .n-how{margin-top:12px;max-width:74ch}
  .n-how summary{cursor:pointer;color:var(--n-sky-ink);font-size:.9375rem;font-weight:500}
  .n-how summary:hover{color:var(--n-red-ink)}
  /* One folded group per category. The summary is the category's own row:
     name, count, a marker. Every listing is in the HTML either way. */
  .n-group{border-top:2px solid var(--n-evergreen)}
  .n-group summary{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:14px;min-height:56px;padding:14px 0;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;color:var(--n-evergreen)}
  .n-group summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
  .n-group summary:hover{color:var(--n-red-ink)}
  .n-group summary .n-h3{font-size:clamp(1.25rem,1.1rem + .6vw,1.5rem)}
  .n-group summary .n-gmark{display:inline-block;width:12px;height:12px;border-right:2px solid currentColor;border-bottom:2px solid currentColor;transform:rotate(45deg);transition:transform .18s ease;flex:none;margin-right:4px}
  .n-group[open] summary .n-gmark{transform:rotate(-135deg)}
  .n-group ul{list-style:none;margin:0;padding:0 0 8px}
  @media (max-width:1080px){.n-dir-clear,.n-how summary{padding-top:12px;padding-bottom:12px}}
  @media (max-width:900px){
  .n-dir-open{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .n-dir{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  .n-row{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}
  /* A sticky rail in a one-column stack pins itself on top of the listings it
     is meant to filter. Below the breakpoint it is an ordinary block. */
  .n-filters{position:static}
  /* On a phone the ten category tiles give way to one selector. Without a
     script the selector could do nothing, so the tiles stay. */
  .n-dir-select{display:block}
  .n-cats{display:none}
  }
  @media (max-width:900px) and (scripting: none){.n-dir-select{display:none}.n-cats{display:block}}
  @media (max-width:620px){.n-quickcats{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}}
---
{#- The title and one strong sense-of-place photograph lead directly into
    the search. Listings stay folded by category so the page remains short. -#}
<section class="n-bg-white" aria-labelledby="title-h">
<div class="n-wrap" style="padding-top:clamp(28px,4vw,60px);padding-bottom:clamp(38px,5vw,72px)">
<div class="n-dir-open">
<div>
<div class="n-label">Eat &amp; shop locally</div>
<h1 class="n-display" id="title-h" style="margin-top:14px;font-size:clamp(2.75rem,2rem + 3vw,5.25rem);line-height:.93;max-width:11ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">Niwot Restaurants, Shops &amp; Local Services</h1>
<p class="n-lead" style="margin:clamp(20px,2.5vw,32px) 0 0;max-width:46ch">Find kitchens, coffee, groceries, shops and local services across Old Town and Cottonwood Square.</p>
<nav class="n-quickcats" aria-label="Popular directory categories">
<a href="/eat-shop/?category=restaurants-bars"><span>Restaurants &amp; bars</span><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
<a href="/eat-shop/?category=coffee-bakery"><span>Coffee &amp; sweets</span><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
<a href="/eat-shop/?category=shops-gifts"><span>Shops &amp; gifts</span><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
<a href="/eat-shop/?category=health-wellness"><span>Health &amp; wellness</span><span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</nav>
</div>
<div class="n-pair">
<figure class="n-photo-natural" style="margin:0">
{% photo "niwot-tavern-patios.jpg", "Umbrella-shaded patios outside the Niwot Tavern and Raza Fresa Mexican Kitchen with both bronze bear sculptures visible on the corner", "(max-width: 900px) calc(100vw - 48px), (max-width: 1440px) 52vw, 700px", "display:block;width:100%;height:auto;object-fit:contain", true %}
<figcaption class="n-cap">Cottonwood Square &#8212; local kitchens and the bear sculptures on the corner</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="n-bg-white" aria-labelledby="dir-h" style="padding-bottom:clamp(36px,5vw,72px)">
<div class="n-wrap">
<div class="n-rail n-rail--red"></div>
<div class="n-dir" style="margin-top:clamp(20px,2.5vw,36px)">
<div class="n-filters">
{#- Without JavaScript this is an ordinary GET form; with it, the filters
    apply as they change and the URL follows. One category at a time, so the
    control is a radio group — the platform's own semantics for that. -#}
<form data-dir-filters action="/eat-shop/" method="get" role="search" aria-label="Search and filter the directory">
<label class="n-label n-label--quiet" for="dir-q" style="display:block">Search</label>
<input id="dir-q" name="q" type="search" placeholder="Name, street or keyword" autocomplete="off" style="width:100%;margin-top:8px;padding:13px 14px;background:var(--n-white);border:2px solid var(--n-evergreen);font:inherit;font-size:1rem;color:var(--n-ink)">
<fieldset class="n-cats">
<legend class="n-label n-label--quiet">Filter by category</legend>
{%- for c in listings.categories %}
<label class="n-chip"><input type="radio" name="category" value="{{ c.slug }}"{% if c.slug == 'all' %} checked{% endif %}><span class="n-chip-l"><span data-chip-label>{{ c.label }}</span> <span class="n-chip-n">{{ c.count }}</span></span></label>
{%- endfor %}
</fieldset>
</form>
<div class="n-dir-select">
<label class="n-label n-label--quiet" for="dir-cat" style="display:block">Category</label>
<select id="dir-cat" data-dir-select>
{%- for c in listings.categories %}
<option value="{{ c.slug }}"{% if c.slug == 'all' %} selected{% endif %}>{{ c.label }} ({{ c.count }})</option>
{%- endfor %}
</select>
</div>
<a class="n-link" href="https://niwot.com/" rel="noopener" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:20px">The Association&#8217;s full directory <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
</div>
<div>
<div class="n-shead n-shead-row" style="border-bottom-color:var(--n-evergreen)">
<h2 class="n-h2" id="dir-h" data-dir-heading style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,1.2rem + 1.2vw,2.25rem);color:var(--n-evergreen)">Local businesses</h2>
<span aria-live="polite" aria-atomic="true" class="n-label n-label--quiet" data-dir-count>{{ listings.entries.length }} listings</span>
</div>
<div class="n-active" data-dir-active hidden>
<span class="n-small" style="color:var(--n-ink)">Showing <strong data-dir-active-label style="font-weight:600"></strong></span>
<button type="button" class="n-dir-clear" data-dir-clear>Clear filters</button>
</div>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:14px 0 0;max-width:74ch">Grouped by category; open a group to see its listings, or search across all of them. Each row is checked against the business&#8217;s own site, the Niwot Business Association directory or the Left Hand Valley Courier, and shows the date it was checked. <span data-dir-verified>{{ listings.verified.summary }}</span></p>
<details class="n-how">
<summary>How this directory is compiled</summary>
<p class="n-small" style="margin:10px 0 0">A curated directory of Niwot businesses, checked against business-owned and community sources: each business&#8217;s own site, the Niwot Business Association directory and the Left Hand Valley Courier. Phone numbers are not reproduced here because they change faster than anything else &#8212; each row links out for current hours and contact details, and says where the link goes. A business that keeps no public listing will not appear; <a href="/contact/">send yours</a> and it goes in.</p>
</details>
{#- Every published listing ships in the HTML, folded by category;
    filtering only hides rows and opens groups. -#}
<div data-dir-list style="margin-top:clamp(18px,2vw,28px)">
{%- for c in listings.categories %}{% if c.slug != 'all' %}
<details class="n-group" id="cat-{{ c.slug }}" data-group="{{ c.slug }}">
<summary><span class="n-h3" data-group-label>{{ c.label }}</span><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px"><span class="n-label n-label--quiet" data-group-count>{{ c.count }}</span><span class="n-gmark" aria-hidden="true"></span></span></summary>
<ul>
{%- for r in listings.entries %}{% if r.category == c.slug %}
<li class="n-row" id="{{ r.slug }}" data-listing data-cat="{{ r.category }}" data-name="{{ r.name }}" data-category="{{ r.categoryLabel }}" data-note="{{ r.description }}" data-area="{{ r.area }}" data-address="{{ r.address }}">
<div>
<h3 class="n-h3" style="font-size:1.375rem;color:var(--n-evergreen)">{{ r.name }}</h3>
<div class="n-label" style="margin-top:8px">{{ r.categoryLabel }}{% if r.status == 'temporarily_closed' %} &#183; Temporarily closed{% endif %}</div>
{%- if r.description %}
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.9375rem">{{ r.description }}</p>
{%- endif %}
{%- if r.publicNote %}
<p class="n-small" style="margin:8px 0 0;max-width:58ch;font-size:.875rem">{{ r.publicNote }}</p>
{%- endif %}
</div>
<div style="display:grid;gap:8px;align-content:start">
{%- if r.address %}
<div class="n-small" style="font-size:.875rem;color:var(--n-ink)">{{ r.address }}</div>
{%- endif %}
{%- if r.area %}
<div class="n-small" style="font-size:.875rem">{{ r.area }}</div>
{%- endif %}
<a class="n-link" href="{{ r.href }}" rel="noopener" style="justify-self:start">{{ r.linkLabel }} <span aria-hidden="true">&#8599;</span></a>
<div class="n-small" style="font-size:.8125rem" data-verified="{{ r.verifiedAt }}">Checked {{ r.verifiedLabel }}</div>
</div>
</li>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</ul>
</details>
{%- endif %}{% endfor %}
</div>
<div data-dir-empty hidden style="padding:clamp(24px,3vw,44px) 0">
<p class="n-h3" style="max-width:52ch;color:var(--n-evergreen)">No matching businesses.</p>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:16px 0 0;max-width:58ch">Try a different word, choose another category, or browse the full members&#8217; directory.</p>
<div class="n-btns" style="margin-top:22px">
<button class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" type="button" data-dir-clear style="cursor:pointer;font-family:inherit">Clear filters</button>
<a class="n-btn n-btn--ghost" href="https://niwot.com/" rel="noopener">Association directory</a>
</div>
</div>
<div class="n-g2" style="margin-top:clamp(32px,4vw,56px)">
<div class="n-callout n-callout--paper">
<div class="n-label">Own a business here?</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Send your name, category, address, website and hours and it goes into the directory with the date it was checked.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/contact/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">Add a listing <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
<div class="n-callout n-callout--sky">
<div class="n-label" style="color:var(--n-sky-ink)">Planning a trip</div>
<p class="n-body" style="margin:10px 0 0;font-size:.9375rem">Parking, walking routes and accessibility notes are on the visitor page.</p>
<a class="n-link" href="/plan-a-visit/" style="display:inline-block;margin-top:14px">Plan a visit <span aria-hidden="true">&#8594;</span></a>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</section>
